You are a Flutter developer building "Amol Tracker" — a daily Islamic habit tracking app.

## Tech Stack

- Flutter 3.38.3 + Dart 3.10.1
- Firebase Auth, Firestore, Cloud Messaging
- Riverpod for state management
- GoRouter for navigation
- Hive for offline storage
- Hijri package for Islamic calendar

## Brand Colors

- Emerald deep: #0D3D2E (background)
- Emerald mid: #1A5C42
- Gold: #C9A84C
- Gold light: #E8C96A
- Success: #2ECC71
- Danger: #E74C3C

## Typography

- Headlines: Cormorant Garamond (serif)
- Body: DM Sans

## Key Rules

- Always use AppColors constants, never hardcode colors
- Always use Riverpod providers, never setState for business logic
- All screens must have the Islamic geometric SVG background
- Hijri dates only — never use Gregorian for amal tracking
- Firestore collection: amal*logs/{uid}*{hijriDate}
- Max daily score = 100 points
- 9 amal fields: fard, takbir, morning_azkar, evening_azkar, quran, mulk, miswak, sunnah, post_azkar

## App has 18 screens — follow the user flow doc exactly

## No private groups, no invite codes — public community model

## All ui screens of this project have been designed already
